{"availability":"available","full":"jeeliz/jeelizFaceFilter","name":"jeelizFaceFilter","description":"🎭 Lightweight WebGL & JavaScript library for real-time multi-face detection, tracking and augmented-reality face filters. Supports rotation, mouth-opening and integrates with Three.js, Babylon.js, Canvas2D and CSS3D","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":2939,"forks":549,"created":"2018-02-16T21:43:54Z","updated":"2025-11-14T13:50:59Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://jeeliz.com","topics":["3d","augmented-reality","camera","deep-learning","detection","face","face-detect","face-detection","face-filters","face-tracking","faceswap","javascript","lightweight","multiple-faces","snapchat","threejs","tracking","webar","webgl"],"demo":"https://jeeliz.com/demos/faceFilter/demos/threejs/daft_punk/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:08.239Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:08.239Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:08.239Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T21:32:08.239Z","stars":2939,"forks":549}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This JavaScript library detects and tracks the face in real time from the camera video feed captured with WebRTC. Then it is possible to overlay 3D content for augmented reality applications. We provide various demonstrations using the main WebGL 3D engines. We have included in this repository the release versions of the 3D engines to work with a determined version (they are in /libs//).","This library is lightweight and it does not include any 3D engine or third party library. We want to keep it framework agnostic so the outputs of the library are raw: if the face is detected or not, the position and the scale of the detected face and the rotation Euler angles. But thanks to the featured helpers, examples and boilerplates, you can quickly deal with a higher level context (for motion head tracking, for face filter or face replacement...). We continuously add new demonstrations, so stay tuned!"],"features":["face rotation detection,","mouth opening detection,","multiple faces detection and tracking,","very robust for all lighting conditions,","video acquisition with HD video ability,"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jeeliz/jeelizFaceFilter/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"005cd720e7423344cb39143ebee671bc11e228c25237774249c0b9cfa24f222b","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:08.354Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:08.354Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This JavaScript library detects and tracks the face in real time from the camera video feed captured with WebRTC. Then it is possible to overlay 3D content for augmented reality applications. We provide various demonstrations using the main WebGL 3D engines. We have included in this repository the release versions of the 3D engines to work with a determined version (they are in /libs//).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jeeliz/jeelizFaceFilter/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"005cd720e7423344cb39143ebee671bc11e228c25237774249c0b9cfa24f222b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jeeliz/jeelizFaceFilter/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:08.355Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-11-14T13:50:59Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jeeliz/jeelizFaceFilter/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:08.358Z","hash":"005cd720e7423344cb39143ebee671bc11e228c25237774249c0b9cfa24f222b","originalBytes":55621,"storedBytes":55621,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["demos","demo","code","face","source","live","video","detection","library","threejs","using","webgl","canvas","neural","camera","head","default","should","user","network","javascript","react","function","element","neuralnets","tracking","value","init","see","set","width","between","boilerplate","error","here","json","three.js","based","called","rendering","these","value